{"slug":"a-j-r","ar":"ء ج ر","total":108,"core":"wage; reward; hiring","forms":[{"ar":"أَجْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":105,"gloss":"Wage, payment; reward","word":"ajr","ex":{"s":68,"a":3,"p":3,"ar":["وَإِنَّ","لَكَ","لَأَجْرًا","غَيْرَ","مَمْنُونٍ"],"en":"And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَـْٔجَرْ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":2,"gloss":"to hire","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":26,"p":4,"ar":["قَالَتْ","إِحْدَىٰهُمَا","يَـٰٓأَبَتِ","ٱسْتَـْٔجِرْهُ ۖ","إِنَّ","خَيْرَ","مَنِ","ٱسْتَـْٔجَرْتَ","ٱلْقَوِىُّ","ٱلْأَمِينُ"],"en":"One of the women said, \"O my father, hire him. Indeed, the best one you can hire is the strong and the trustworthy"}},{"ar":"تَأْجُرَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to serve for hire","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":27,"p":11,"ar":["قَالَ","إِنِّىٓ","أُرِيدُ","أَنْ","أُنكِحَكَ","إِحْدَى","ٱبْنَتَىَّ","هَـٰتَيْنِ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","تَأْجُرَنِى","ثَمَـٰنِىَ","حِجَجٍ ۖ","فَإِنْ","أَتْمَمْتَ","عَشْرًا","فَمِنْ","عِندِكَ ۖ","وَمَآ","أُرِيدُ","أَنْ","أَشُقَّ","عَلَيْكَ ۚ","سَتَجِدُنِىٓ","إِن","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","مِنَ","ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ"],"en":"He said, \"Indeed, I wish to wed you one of these, my two daughters, on [the condition] that you serve me for eight years; but if you complete ten, it will be [as a favor] from you. And I do not wish to put you in difficulty. You will find me, if Allah wills, from among the righteous"}}],"surahs":[[4,12],[26,11],[3,7],[2,5],[11,5],[28,5],[33,5],[57,5],[12,4],[16,3],[18,3],[39,3],[48,3],[5,2],[7,2],[9,2],[10,2],[29,2],[34,2],[35,2],[36,2],[42,2],[65,2],[68,2],[6,1],[8,1],[17,1],[25,1],[38,1],[41,1],[47,1],[49,1],[52,1],[60,1],[64,1],[67,1],[73,1],[84,1],[95,1]]}